.TH "pi" "1" "2026-11-18"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
pi - build and manage packages
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBpi\fR [--root \fIPATH\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGUMENT\fR.\&.\&.\&]
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBpi\fR builds packages and manages an installed package database.\&  The
optional \fB--root\fR argument makes all package state relative to \fIPATH\fR
instead of the system root.\&
.PP
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBbuild\fR \fIPACKAGE\fR
.RS 4
Build \fIPACKAGE\fR from its cached source.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBsync\fR \fIREPOSITORY\fR \fIINDEX\fR
.RS 4
Fetch a repository index from \fIREPOSITORY\fR and store it as \fIINDEX\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBinstall\fR \fIARCHIVE\fR.\&.\&.\&
.RS 4
Install one or more package archives.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBremove\fR \fIPACKAGE\fR
.RS 4
Remove an installed package.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBupgrade\fR
.RS 4
Upgrade installed packages.\&  Repository orchestration must be configured.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBautoremove\fR
.RS 4
Remove packages no longer needed by another package.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBsearch\fR \fIQUERY\fR
.RS 4
Search synchronized repository indexes.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBverify\fR \fIPACKAGE\fR
.RS 4
Verify the installed package and print \fBOK\fR or \fBCORRUPTED\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBinfo\fR \fIPACKAGE\fR
.RS 4
Print metadata for an installed package.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBclean\fR [--keep \fIN\fR]
.RS 4
Remove cached package data, retaining \fIN\fR generations (two by default).\&
.PP
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--root\fR \fIPATH\fR
.RS 4
Use \fIPATH\fR as the package database, cache, and staging root.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB--keep\fR \fIN\fR
.RS 4
With \fBclean\fR, retain \fIN\fR cache generations.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH FILES
.PP
\fB/var/db/pi/\fR
.RS 4
Installed package database and the world set.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB/var/cache/pi/\fR
.RS 4
Package sources, archives, and staging files.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.PP
0
.RS 4
The operation succeeded.\&
.PP
.RE
2
.RS 4
The command line was invalid.\&
.PP
.RE
Non-zero
.RS 4
The operation failed; the value is an operating-system error number when
available.\&
.PP
.RE
